WEBVTT

00:00:01.853 --> 00:00:06.149
Excuse me. Do you mind?
Everywhere else is full.

00:00:11.654 --> 00:00:14.073
I'm Ron, by the way. Ron Weasley.

00:00:14.323 --> 00:00:16.951
I'm Harry. Harry Potter.

00:00:18.327 --> 00:00:20.371
So it's true!

00:00:20.580 --> 00:00:23.374
I mean, do you really have the...?

00:00:23.958 --> 00:00:26.836
- The what?
- The scar?

00:00:27.336 --> 00:00:29.380
Oh, yeah.

00:00:34.677 --> 00:00:39.849
- Anything off the trolley, dears?
- No, thanks. I'm all set.

00:00:43.895 --> 00:00:46.189
We'll take the lot.

00:00:56.908 --> 00:01:01.704
- Bertie bott's every flavor beans?
- They mean every flavor.

00:01:02.121 --> 00:01:05.500
There's chocolate
and peppermint and also...

00:01:05.708 --> 00:01:09.545
Spinach, liver and tripe.

00:01:09.754 --> 00:01:13.925
George sweared he got
a booger-flavored one once.

00:01:18.596 --> 00:01:23.935
- Are they real frogs?
- It's a spell. You want the cards.

00:01:24.143 --> 00:01:29.607
Each pack's got a famous witch
or wizard. I've got about 500 meself.

00:01:35.404 --> 00:01:39.200
That's rotten luck. They've only
got one good jump in them.

00:01:42.078 --> 00:01:45.957
- I've got Dumbledore!
- I got about six of him.

00:01:47.750 --> 00:01:49.293
Hey, he's gone!

00:01:49.460 --> 00:01:52.964
You can't expect him to
hang around all day, can you?

00:01:53.589 --> 00:01:56.717
This is scabbers. Pathetic, isn't he?

00:01:56.926 --> 00:01:58.094
A little.

00:01:58.302 --> 00:02:01.639
Fred gave me a spell
to turn him yellow. Want to see?

00:02:10.648 --> 00:02:12.275
Has anyone seen a toad?

00:02:12.650 --> 00:02:15.319
- A boy named Neville's lost one.
- No.

00:02:15.903 --> 00:02:20.241
Oh, are you doing magic?
Let's see, then.

00:02:21.284 --> 00:02:25.621
Sunshine, daisies, butter mellow

00:02:25.830 --> 00:02:28.958
turn this stupid, fat rat yellow

00:02:31.711 --> 00:02:37.341
are you sure that's a real spell?
Well, it's not very good, is it?

00:02:37.508 --> 00:02:40.803
I've only tried
a few simple ones myself...

00:02:41.012 --> 00:02:43.639
But they've all worked for me.

00:02:47.268 --> 00:02:49.312
For example:

00:02:49.687 --> 00:02:52.481
Oculus reparo.

00:02:54.525 --> 00:02:57.194
That's better, isn't it?

00:02:58.362 --> 00:03:02.283
Holy cricket, you're Harry Potter!

00:03:02.491 --> 00:03:06.037
I'm Hermione Granger.
And you are...?

00:03:06.787 --> 00:03:09.999
- I'm Ron Weasley.
- Pleasure.

00:03:10.207 --> 00:03:15.296
You two better change into robes.
I expect we'll be arriving soon.

00:03:19.383 --> 00:03:22.887
You've got dirt on your nose.
Did you know?

00:03:23.054 --> 00:03:25.056
Just there.

